{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10452","headline":"别韦参军 · 高适","name":"别韦参军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二十解书劒，西游长安城。\n举头望君门，屈指取公卿。\n国风冲融迈三五，朝廷欢乐弥寰宇。\n白璧皆言赐近臣，布衣不得干明主。\n归来洛阳无负郭，东过梁宋非吾土。\n兔苑爲农岁不登，雁池垂钓心长苦。\n世人遇我同衆人，唯君於我最相亲。\n且喜百年有交态，未尝一日辞家贫。\n弹棊击筑白日晚，纵酒高歌杨柳春。\n欢娱未尽分散去，使我惆怅惊心神。\n丈夫不作儿女别，临岐涕泪沾衣巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}